	(text_box "Hall Sensor Inputs\n\nAssume VH required by motor hall sensors is 5V, but expose pad to switch to 3V3, if desired\n\nUM2896 5.4: Recommends CH1-3 of TIM3 (PB4, PB5, PB0) for HA, HB, HC\n\nOptional MOTOR_TEMP pin if chosen motor provides winding temps (Note: This is different from the one in Control sheet)\n\nDC12_IN6 on PC0 used for MOTOR_TEMP based on availability\n-> Might change based on needs of ADC since other ADC inputs not yet implemented\n\nPull-up resistors since sensor is open drain\n\nDiodes to clamp voltage at 3V3 to protect MCU\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 132.08 86.36 0)
		(size 35.56 58.42)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
